      "writtenOn": "2017-05-04T18:32:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Gwendal and I talked before I made this change, decided it best to have its own define.  200Hz was chosen as the \"max freq\" that the EC can reasonably support.  If someone has a more powerful EC, they could override this value in their board.h if they wanted to.\n\nI can move the constant into motion_sense.h if that makes more sense.",
